OL,3,GNEWSAHuge recycling centre blaze
OL,4,A'caused by battery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large blaze at a recycling plant in
OL,7,FWorcestershire was caused by a battery,
OL,8,Fa fire service has said.
OL,10,FAt its height, 50 firefighters tackled
OL,11,Fthe fire at Total Metal Recovery Ltd in
OL,12,FStoke Prior, near Bromsgrove.
OL,14,FThe service said it started at about
OL,15,F03:40 BST on Monday, with about six
OL,16,Fcrews expected to remain on scene for
OL,17,Fthe rest of the day.
OL,19,FGroup commander Simon Cusack said the
OL,20,Ffire had been "largely extinguished",
OL,21,Fadding: "Now what we're doing is moving
OL,22,Fthe rubbish pile and extinguishing it."
